$ jailops jail create web --image freebsd-15@stable --network lan --storage default
jail/web created

$ jailops jail snapshot create web good
snapshot/good created

$ jailops jail snapshot create web newer
snapshot/newer created

$ jailops jail rollback web --data --snapshot good
Rolling back data of jail web to snapshot good (taken 3h ago).
1.5 MiB written since then would be discarded.
! This destroys 1.5 MiB of data written to jail "web" since snapshot "good". It cannot be undone.
! Type the name "web" to confirm: 
! usage: confirmation required
! hint: type the name on standard input, or pass --confirm-data-loss
[exit 2]

$ jailops jail rollback web --data --snapshot good -y
Rolling back data of jail web to snapshot good (taken 3h ago).
1.5 MiB written since then would be discarded.
! This destroys 1.5 MiB of data written to jail "web" since snapshot "good". It cannot be undone.
! Type the name "web" to confirm: 
! usage: confirmation required
! hint: type the name on standard input, or pass --confirm-data-loss
[exit 2]

$ jailops jail rollback web --data --snapshot good
Rolling back data of jail web to snapshot good (taken 3h ago).
1.5 MiB written since then would be discarded.
! This destroys 1.5 MiB of data written to jail "web" since snapshot "good". It cannot be undone.
! Type the name "web" to confirm: aborted: the name did not match, nothing was changed
[exit 1]

$ jailops jail rollback web --data --snapshot good --dry-run
Rolling back data of jail web to snapshot good (taken 3h ago).
1.5 MiB written since then would be discarded.
dry-run: would roll back jail web
scope: data
snapshot: good
confirm_data_loss: true

$ jailops jail rollback web --data --all
! usage: choose one of --root, --data and --all
! hint: run 'jailops jail rollback --help' for usage
[exit 2]

$ jailops jail rollback web --data
Rolling back data of jail web to snapshot newer (taken 3h ago).
10 B written since then would be discarded.
jail/web rolled back
! This destroys 10 B of data written to jail "web" since snapshot "newer". It cannot be undone.
! Type the name "web" to confirm: 

$ jailops jail rollback web --all --snapshot good --confirm-data-loss
Rolling back all of jail web to snapshot good (taken 3h ago).
2.0 KiB written since then would be discarded.
jail/web rolled back

$ jailops jail rollback web
! invalid: jail "web" has no previous generation
! hint: Read the message, correct the named field and retry; 'jailops firewall validate' checks rules offline. (jailops explain invalid)
[exit 2]

$ jailops jail upgrade web
jail/web upgraded to g2

$ jailops jail rollback web --root
jail/web rolled back

